Manage fine-tuning jobs

Usage
  azd ai finetuning jobs [command]

Available Commands
  cancel : Cancels a running or queued fine-tuning job.
  deploy : Deploy a fine-tuned model to Azure Cognitive Services
  list   : List fine-tuning jobs.
  pause  : Pauses a running fine-tuning job.
  resume : Resumes a paused fine-tuning job.
  show   : Shows detailed information about a specific job.
  submit : Submit fine-tuning job.

Global Flags
      --debug                   : Enable debug mode
  -h, --help                    : help for jobs
      --no-prompt               : Runs without prompts. Uses existing values; fails if any required value or decision cannot be resolved automatically.
      --project-endpoint string : Azure AI Foundry project endpoint URL (e.g., https://account.services.ai.azure.com/api/projects/project-name)
  -s, --subscription string     : Azure subscription ID (enables implicit init if environment not configured)

Examples
  Submit a job and list recent jobs
    azd ai finetuning jobs submit --file fine-tuning.yaml
    azd ai finetuning jobs list

Use azd ai finetuning jobs [command] --help to view examples and more information about a specific command.
